  "foods.coffeeInATin.description": "Some campfire brewed coffee.",

  "foods.sausageOnAStick.name": "Sausage on a Stick",
  "foods.sausageOnAStick.description": "A sausage on a stick.",
  "foods.sausageOnAStick.unlockHint": "Purchase the recipe from the Cindersap Forest Park shop.",

  // Camping tents
  "campingTents.starterTent.name": "Starter Tent",
  "campingTents.starterTent.description": "Lightweight and simple to pitch. A good first shelter for an aspiring camper.",

  "campingTents.standardTent.name": "Standard Tent",
  "campingTents.standardTent.description": "A solid, weatherproof tent. Roomy enough to sleep comfortably.",

  // Map
  "map.cindersapForestCampground.name": "Cindersap Forest Campground",

  // Villager camping dialogue - Abigail
  "villagers.abigail.inviteAccepted1": "Camping? Count me in!$h",
  "villagers.abigail.inviteRejected1": "Camping? With you? Uh... no thanks.$s",
  "villagers.abigail.likedDayOf1": "This spot is awesome! It feels like the start of an adventure.$h",
  "villagers.abigail.likedDayOf2": "Thanks for inviting me!$h",
  "villagers.abigail.neutralDayOf1": "Not a bad spot. Let me know where I can help out!",
  "villagers.abigail.dislikedDayOf1": "This is the spot you picked? Well... better than being stuck in my room all day.$s",
  "villagers.abigail.likedDayAfter1": "I have to tell Sebastian and Sam how fun it was. They totally have to come next time.$h",
  "villagers.abigail.likedDayAfter2": "Thanks again for bringing me along!",
  "villagers.abigail.neutralDayAfter1": "The food last night was actually pretty good.",
  "villagers.abigail.neutralDayAfter2": "Is it weird to want roasted marshmallows for breakfast?$h",
  "villagers.abigail.dislikedDayAfter1": "Next time let's camp somewhere with a little more... atmosphere.$s",

  // Villager camping dialogue - Emily
  "villagers.emily.inviteAccepted1": "Camping? Oh, I'd love to! Sleeping under the open sky does wonders for your energy...$h",
  "villagers.emily.inviteRejected1": "Oh, I wish I could! But I'm working at the saloon tonight. Next time?$s",
  "villagers.emily.likedDayOf1": "Wow, the energy here is amazing!$h",
  "villagers.emily.likedDayOf2": "Can you feel it? The whole clearing is practically glowing.",
  "villagers.emily.neutralDayOf1": "This is a peaceful little spot!$h",
  "villagers.emily.neutralDayOf2": "I might do some meditating before dinner. Do you want to join?$h",
  "villagers.emily.dislikedDayOf1": "Hmm... the energy here feels a little stagnant.$s",
  "villagers.emily.dislikedDayOf2": "No worries, though! Nothing a dance around the campfire can't fix.$h",
  "villagers.emily.likedDayAfter1": "Dancing around the fire under the stars... I felt so free!$h",
  "villagers.emily.likedDayAfter2": "We really must do this again.",
  "villagers.emily.neutralDayAfter1": "There's just something about a meal cooked over an open flame. It just tastes better, you know?",
  "villagers.emily.dislikedDayAfter1": "We should find a place where the energy flows a little better.",

  // Villager camping dialogue - Haley
  "villagers.haley.inviteAccepted1": "Camping? Like... outside, in the dirt?$a",
  "villagers.haley.inviteAccepted2": "Fine, but only because the light out there is supposed to be AMAZING for photos.$h",
  "villagers.haley.inviteRejected1": "Ew... No.$s",
  "villagers.haley.likedDayOf1": "This is actually... kind of pretty?$h",
  "villagers.haley.likedDayOf2": "Don't tell anyone I said that.$neutral",
  "villagers.haley.neutralDayOf1": "It's nicer out here than I thought.$neutral",
  "villagers.haley.neutralDayOf2": "I'm still not touching any bugs, though. That's your job.$h",
  "villagers.haley.dislikedDayOf1": "Ugh... There is mud everywhere. This better be worth it.$s",
  "villagers.haley.likedDayAfter1": "Okay, I admit it! I had fun camping with you.$h",
  "villagers.haley.likedDayAfter2": "We should do it again... after I wash my hair like three times.$neutral",
  "villagers.haley.neutralDayAfter1": "The s'mores were the best part of this trip.$h",
  "villagers.haley.neutralDayAfter2": "I wonder if we have time to make some more before heading out?$neutral",
  "villagers.haley.dislikedDayAfter1": "I couldn't sleep at all last night.$s",
  "villagers.haley.dislikedDayAfter2": "Next time we're going somewhere with, like... walls.",

  // Villager camping dialogue - Leah
  "villagers.leah.inviteAccepted1": "Camping? I would love to go! I'll bring my sketchbook... nature always looks different at dusk.$h",
  "villagers.leah.inviteRejected1": "Oh... I appreciate the thought. Maybe another time?$s",
  "villagers.leah.likedDayOf1": "This spot is beautiful! Look at the light coming through the trees... I have to sketch this before it changes.$h",
  "villagers.leah.likedDayOf2": "Being out here reminds me why I left the city. Thank you for inviting me.$h",
  "villagers.leah.neutralDayOf1": "This is nice. I think I saw some wild plants on the walk in...",
  "villagers.leah.neutralDayOf2": "Want me to forage something up for dinner?$h",
  "villagers.leah.dislikedDayOf1": "Hmm... it's a little bare out here, honestly.$s",
  "villagers.leah.dislikedDayOf2": "But every landscape has something worth drawing if you look long enough.$neutral",
  "villagers.leah.likedDayAfter1": "I made some good sketches last night! I might just turn one of them into a painting.$h",
  "villagers.leah.likedDayAfter2": "There's just something about firelight...We have to do that again sometime.$h",
  "villagers.leah.neutralDayAfter1": "Dinner by the campfire was lovely. Food always tastes better outdoors, don't you think?",
  "villagers.leah.dislikedDayAfter1": "I can't wait to be back home...$s",
  "villagers.leah.dislikedDayAfter2": "Next time, let's find somewhere with a bit more life to it.",

  // Villager camping dialogue - Maru
  "villagers.maru.inviteAccepted1": "Camping? Yes! The visibility away from town should be incredible... I'll bring my telescope.$h",
  "villagers.maru.inviteRejected1": "Oh, that sounds fun... but I'm on shift at the clinic today.$s",
  "villagers.maru.likedDayOf1": "This site is perfect!$h",
  "villagers.maru.likedDayOf2": "I have a feeling tonight's sky is going to be amazing.",
  "villagers.maru.neutralDayOf1": "This is a nice spot.",
  "villagers.maru.neutralDayOf2": "Want some help setting up? Let me see if I can tidy up our tents.$h",
  "villagers.maru.dislikedDayOf1": "Hm, this is not exactly the camping spot I imagined.$s",
  "villagers.maru.dislikedDayOf2": "Oh well, best to make due with what we have!",
  "villagers.maru.likedDayAfter1": "I've been up since sunrise taking notes. There is just so much to observe out here...",
  "villagers.maru.likedDayAfter2": "Can we stay another night? ...just kidding! Mostly.$h",
  "villagers.maru.neutralDayAfter1": "I slept better than expected!$h",
  "villagers.maru.neutralDayAfter2": "There is just something about sleeping outdoors that is really refreshing.",
  "villagers.maru.dislikedDayAfter1": "The cloud cover last night ruined my observations.$s",
  "villagers.maru.dislikedDayAfter2": "Something also chewed on my equipment bag...$s",

  // Villager camping dialogue - Penny
  "villagers.penny.inviteAccepted1": "Camping? Oh... I would really like that.",
  "villagers.penny.inviteAccepted2": "It will be nice to get away for a night!$h",
  "villagers.penny.inviteRejected1": "Oh, I'm sorry... I promised Jas and Vincent I would help them with their lessons today.$s",
  "villagers.penny.likedDayOf1": "It's lovely out here... This is exactly the kind of place I daydream about.$h",
  "villagers.penny.likedDayOf2": "Thank you for thinking of me. I... don't get invited on adventures very often.",
  "villagers.penny.neutralDayOf1": "This is a nice little spot. Let me see if I can put together some firewood.$h",
  "villagers.penny.dislikedDayOf1": "Oh... it's a little rough out here, isn't it?",
  "villagers.penny.dislikedDayOf2": "Sorry, I don't mean to complain...$s",
  "villagers.penny.likedDayAfter1": "I read by firelight until I couldn't keep my eyes open... I can't remember the last time I felt this peaceful.$h",
  "villagers.penny.likedDayAfter2": "I should see about bringing the kids out here. I am sure they would love it!$h",
  "villagers.penny.neutralDayAfter1": "I hope you slept well. I thought I would tidy up around the tents a bit before breakfast.",
  "villagers.penny.neutralDayAfter2": "The soup over the campfire last night reminded me of cooking at home... only it actually turned out well this time.$h",
  "villagers.penny.dislikedDayAfter1": "I didn't sleep very well... the ground was harder than I expected.$s",
  "villagers.penny.dislikedDayAfter2": "But please don't feel bad. I'm still glad you invited me.$neutral",

  // Villager camping dialogue - Alex
  "villagers.alex.inviteAccepted1": "Camping? Sure, I'm in! Fresh air, hauling gear... what more could you need?$h",
  "villagers.alex.inviteRejected1": "Nah, sorry. Maybe next time!$s",
  "villagers.alex.likedDayOf1": "Good call inviting me. Someone's gotta carry all the heavy stuff, right?$h",
  "villagers.alex.neutralDayOf1": "Not a bad spot. Is there anything else that needs to be setup?",
  "villagers.alex.dislikedDayOf1": "Kind of a rough spot. Not much room to run around or anything...",
  "villagers.alex.dislikedDayOf2": "Whatever, I'll just do push-ups until dinner.$s",
  "villagers.alex.likedDayAfter1": "Man, I slept like a rock! Something about being outside all day just knocks you out.$h",
  "villagers.alex.likedDayAfter2": "I already got a morning run in around the site while you were still asleep!$h",
  "villagers.alex.neutralDayAfter1": "Morning! Please tell me there's food soon. Outdoor cooking is great and all, but my stomach's been growling since sunrise.",
  "villagers.alex.dislikedDayAfter1": "Ugh, my back is killing me from that ground. Next time we need to find a better spot.$s",

  // Villager camping dialogue - Elliott
  "villagers.elliott.inviteAccepted1": "A night beneath the stars? How could I refuse? Nature has always been the finest muse.$h",
  "villagers.elliott.inviteRejected1": "I'm afraid I must decline... Perhaps another time, my friend.$s",
  "villagers.elliott.likedDayOf1": "You have a poet's eye for location, my friend. This place sings!$h",
  "villagers.elliott.neutralDayOf1": "An agreeable spot, I suppose. I've brought my journal, should inspiration strike.",
  "villagers.elliott.dislikedDayOf1": "I must confess this place leaves... much to be desired.$s",
  "villagers.elliott.likedDayAfter1": "You know, I came here expecting a simple diversion. To think I would find genuine inspiration!$h",
  "villagers.elliott.neutralDayAfter1": "Good morning. I do hope there's some coffee brewing....",
  "villagers.elliott.dislikedDayAfter1": "I barely slept a wink and my hair is an absolute disaster...$s",

  // Villager camping dialogue - Harvey
  "villagers.harvey.inviteAccepted1": "Camping? Oh! Well... yes, I'd love to come along. Fresh air is wonderful for your health, you know.$h",
  "villagers.harvey.inviteRejected1": "Oh, I'm sorry... I really shouldn't leave the clinic unattended.$s",
  "villagers.harvey.likedDayOf1": "This is a lovely spot! And don't worry, I brought a fully stocked first aid kit.$h",
  "villagers.harvey.neutralDayOf1": "Nice place. Remember to stay hydrated, okay? People always underestimate how much water they need.",
  "villagers.harvey.dislikedDayOf1": "Hmm... is that poison oak over there? And the ground looks awfully uneven. Someone could twist an ankle...",
  "villagers.harvey.dislikedDayOf2": "I'm sorry, I don't mean to worry. I'll just... double-check the first aid supplies again.$s",
  "villagers.harvey.likedDayAfter1": "I slept surprisingly well! You know, studies show time in nature genuinely lowers stress levels.$h",
  "villagers.harvey.likedDayAfter2": "I can feel it working already!",
  "villagers.harvey.neutralDayAfter1": "Good morning. I hope you stretched before getting up. Sleeping on the ground can be hard on the spine.",
  "villagers.harvey.dislikedDayAfter1": "I barely slept... every rustle in the bushes had me imagining worst-case scenarios.$s",
  "villagers.harvey.dislikedDayAfter2": "I think I need some coffee...",

  // Villager camping dialogue - Sam
  "villagers.sam.inviteAccepted1": "Hey, hey, hey! A camping trip? Now that's what I'm talking about!$h",
  "villagers.sam.inviteRejected1": "Aw man, I can't today... I promised my little brother I would hang out with him.$s",
  "villagers.sam.likedDayOf1": "This spot is gnarly!$h",
  "villagers.sam.likedDayOf2": "I'm gonna write a note on my wrist so I remember to bring Vincent out here someday. He'd love it.",
  "villagers.sam.neutralDayOf1": "Not bad, not bad.",
  "villagers.sam.neutralDayOf2": "Hey... is it just me, or does the fresh air make you hungry? I'm starving already.",
  "villagers.sam.dislikedDayOf1": "Ugh, my nose is already running. Why'd we have to camp somewhere with so much... nature?$s",
  "villagers.sam.likedDayAfter1": "I stayed up super late playing guitar by the fire, and nobody told me to keep it down. Best. Night. Ever.$h",
  "villagers.sam.likedDayAfter2": "I've totally got ideas for a new song now. Sebastian's gonna be so jealous he missed this.$h",
  "villagers.sam.neutralDayAfter1": "So what's the plan for today? Pack up? More hanging out? I'm good either way, honestly.",
  "villagers.sam.dislikedDayAfter1": "I barely slept, man. I kept thinking a spider was gonna crawl into my mouth or something.$s",
  "villagers.sam.dislikedDayAfter2": "Don't laugh! It could happen!$a",

  // Villager camping dialogue - Sebastian
  "villagers.sebastian.inviteAccepted1": "Camping? Sure, why not. It'll get Demetrius off my back about never leaving my room.$h",
  "villagers.sebastian.inviteRejected1": "Camping? That's... a lot of outside. Maybe another time.",
  "villagers.sebastian.likedDayOf1": "You know, this is the kind of place I'd normally ride my bike to just to be alone. Guess the company's not bad either.$h",
  "villagers.sebastian.neutralDayOf1": "It's fine, I guess. I brought a book, so I'm set either way.",
  "villagers.sebastian.dislikedDayOf1": "I checked around the whole site. Not a single frog. What kind of place is this?$s",
  "villagers.sebastian.likedDayAfter1": "I stayed up most of the night just looking at the sky. The stars out here are unreal...$h",
  "villagers.sebastian.neutralDayAfter1": "Morning. Please tell me somebody brought coffee. I don't function without it.",
  "villagers.sebastian.neutralDayAfter2": "*yawn*... I'm used to being up all night, just... not on the ground.",
  "villagers.sebastian.dislikedDayAfter1": "I barely slept. Give me my windowless room over this any day.$s",

  // Villager camping dialogue - Shane
  "villagers.shane.inviteAccepted1": "Camping? With me? ...You're serious. Huh.$s",
  "villagers.shane.inviteAccepted2": "Sure... Beats another night of frozen pizza and staring at the TV.$h",
  "villagers.shane.inviteRejected1": "Camping? In the woods? On the ground? ...I'll pass.$s",
  "villagers.shane.likedDayOf1": "It's quiet out here. Not the lonely kind of quiet. The good kind.",
  "villagers.shane.likedDayOf2": "There's a difference, trust me.$h",
  "villagers.shane.neutralDayOf1": "So this is camping, huh? ...It's fine, I guess.",
  "villagers.shane.neutralDayOf2": "What do we do now, just... sit here?",
  "villagers.shane.dislikedDayOf1": "The ground's lumpy, there's bugs everywhere... starting to think my luck follows me wherever I go.$s",
  "villagers.shane.likedDayAfter1": "Morning. Don't tell anyone I said this... but I'm glad you dragged me out here.$h",
  "villagers.shane.neutralDayAfter1": "So... do we make breakfast... or is standing around groggy part of the camping experience too?",
  "villagers.shane.dislikedDayAfter1": "That's the worst I've slept in a while... and that's saying something.$s"
}